From 3b052341c3d848af127055b48e8510cf02ab2398 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 13:42:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/sun4i: hdmi-phy: Fix H6 8-bit MPLL config at 594 MHz

The MPLL charge pump/loop filter calibration value at the highest
clock row (594 MHz, 8-bit column) failed to reliably lock a 4K@60
RGB/YUV444 mode on a Tanix TX6 (H6) board with the depth-indexed PHY
resource selection now in place, which is what actually exercises
this exact table entry for that scenario.

Correct the value, found by testing against real hardware. The H616
table has the identical unverified value at the same position, left
untouched since this correction has not been confirmed there.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c
index e02cf3136d7d49..f65db535938981 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c
@@ -91,7 +91,7 @@ static const struct dw_hdmi_mpll_config sun50i_h6_mpll_cfg[] = {
 		},
 	},  {
 		594000000, {
-			{ 0x1a40, 0x0003 },
+			{ 0x1a7c, 0x0003 },
 			{ 0x3b4c, 0x0003 },
 			{ 0x5a64, 0x0003 },
 		},
